# Play test of Keel & Mast (CIPlay keel_and_mast, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the yard at 2 m
# (x -42..-6, z -2..12); Brandvold's house at -38 6; the drying shed at -13 9; the ship at -24 2, her aft deck 7 m at
# z 9..12, the scaffold x -21.5..-18.5, z 9..12 (6.9 m), its ladder at -20 8.8; the east beach's plank at 10 -50; the
# drying rack at -66 2; the spar at -30 -40 (7 m down); the sail loft at 14 -62; the launching rhyme at -28 -3
island Keel & Mast
expect step 0
expect title The Second Wind
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden strakes
expect hidden mast
expect hidden afloat
wait 5

# The yard: the letter, the nail barrel; the three planks - the shed, the east beach, the drying rack (and its bear)
walk -12 3 to -18 4 h=2
zone yard
expect step 0
read Brandvold's letter
expect step 1
open Nail barrel
use plank1
expect story plank 1
use plank2
expect story plank 2
zone dryingrack
use plank3
expect story plank 3
expect step 2
kill Bear
expect step 3

# Up the scaffold onto her deck: the strakes fitted
walk -17 7 to -19.5 8.2 h=2
climb -20 8.8 h=2
climb -20 8.8 h=4.42
climb -20 8.8 h=6.84
expect stand -20.75 10.5 h=6.9 below=8
zone hull
expect step 3
use ship
expect shown strakes
expect story mark 1
expect step 4

# The mast spar on the bay's floor; stepped
zone mastwreck
expect step 5
open Sunk tool chest
use mastspar
expect story mast 1
expect step 6
use maststep
expect shown mast
expect story mark 2
expect step 7

# The loft key from the coat; the sail from the loft; bent on
open Brandvold's coat
expect story loftkey 1
expect step 8
open Sail loft chest
expect step 9
use rigging
expect shown sail
expect story mark 3
expect step 10

# The rhyme; the chocks in its order - she slides into the bay; aboard her afloat; the slip board; the gift
read The launching rhyme
expect step 11
use chockmid
expect message settles back
use chockfore
use chockaft
use chockmid
wait 12
expect shown afloat
expect shown nameboard
zone afloat
expect step 12
read The slip board
expect step 13
open The shipwright's gift
expect done
